The legislative texts in this repository are from cookislandslaws.gov.ck, the consolidated-law database of the Cook
Islands Legislative Service. Under the Copyright Act 2013 (Cook Islands), section 3, a "work" "does not include any
work that is an official text, or a translation, of a legislative, administrative, or legal nature", so the texts
are not protected by copyright. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement (one
file per unit, one paragraph per line) is Lexifina's. This is not an official version.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
